# The Boeing 787-8: JSBSim's 787-8 made to fly to its airport-planning document's
# and type certificate's figures (assets/figures/787-8.xml) by tools/make_787_8.py.
#
#   name TEXT...                 what it is called
#   model NAME                   its JSBSim model, in data/jsbsim/aircraft
#   start AIRSPEED_KT THROTTLE   a flight begun in the air: its calibrated
#                                airspeed, and the throttle that holds it
#
# Its published figures, if it has them, are data/figures/MODEL.xml, and its
# selftest's log data/selftest/MODEL.log (src/sim/catalogue.hpp).

name Boeing 787-8
model 787-8
class airliner
start 250 0.46
# The speedbrake lever works its speedbrakes or spoilers (src/sim/catalogue.hpp).
speedbrakes
# Her main tyres and brakes, for a wet runway's grip (docs/ASSETS.md):
# Boeing D6-58333 rev Q, 7.2: 50x20.0R22 mains at 228 psi loaded, at
# 503,500 lb; Hydro-Aire's digital brake system control.
brakes 228 fully-modulating
# Her Trent 1000s' cascade thrust reversers (tools/make_787_8.py), and the
# reverse brought to idle at 60 kt, as Boeing's training manual has it (the
# 737-300's file says where; docs/ASSETS.md).
reversers 60
